  (text "W5500 and MGMT RJ45 form an independent control/audit path.\\nMGMT never forwards SERVER traffic; it only reaches gateway firmware and control-plane audit.\\nv1A MGMT is 10/100 by design; root-resistant claim depends on path independence, not MGMT line rate." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
